{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <h2>最新天文台天氣報告｜未來五天香港天氣預報</h2>\n    <p>天文台展望，未來兩三日仍有幾陣驟雨。</p>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>日期</cell>\n        <cell>5月17日(日)</cell>\n        <cell>5月18日(一)</cell>\n        <cell>5月19日(二)</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最高溫度</cell>\n        <cell>26度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n        <cell>30度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最低溫度</cell>\n        <cell>23度</cell>\n        <cell>25度</cell>\n        <cell>26度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>風向及級數</cell>\n        <cell>東風5級，離岸及高地達7級，風勢有時疾勁。</cell>\n        <cell>東南風4至5級，初時高地間中6級。</cell>\n        <cell>南至東南風3級。</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>濕度</cell>\n        <cell>80-95%</cell>\n        <cell>75-95%</cell>\n        <cell>75-95%</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>顯著降雨概率</cell>\n        <cell>高</cell>\n        <cell>中高</cell>\n        <cell>中</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>天氣</cell>\n        <cell>多雲，間中有驟雨。</cell>\n        <cell>多雲，有幾陣驟雨。</cell>\n        <cell>大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨。</cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>日期</cell>\n        <cell>5月20日(三)</cell>\n        <cell>5月21日(四)</cell>\n        <cell>5月22日(五)</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最高溫度</cell>\n        <cell>31度</cell>\n        <cell>31度</cell>\n        <cell>32度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最低溫度</cell>\n        <cell>26度</cell>\n        <cell>26度</cell>\n        <cell>27度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>風向及級數</cell>\n        <cell>南風3級。</cell>\n        <cell>南風3級。</cell>\n        <cell>南風3至4級。</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>濕度</cell>\n        <cell>70-95%</cell>\n        <cell>70-95%</cell>\n        <cell>65-85%</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>顯著降雨概率</cell>\n        <cell>中</cell>\n        <cell>中</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>天氣</cell>\n        <cell>大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨。日間短暫時間有陽光。</cell>\n        <cell>大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨。日間短暫時間有陽光。</cell>\n        <cell>部分時間有陽光。日間炎熱。局部地區有驟雨。</cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T23:56:40.374157+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":427,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}